==Trivia==
*Tisha's [[Ability]] used to give a 33% [[Movement Speed]] boost, but it was later nerfed to 25% Movement Speed in [[Changelog|v0.2.1]].
**It used to not clean up [[Ichor]] related [[Debuff]] sources until v0.24.1.
*Although the exact reason is unknown, {{CI|Vee|name=true}} and Tisha appear to potentially have tension with one another, as seen in their dialogues.
*Tisha and {{CI|Shelly|name=true}} are friends, as she often tags along with Shelly, mainly in the latter finding and cleaning fossils.
**Coincidentally, Tisha's [[Mastery]] is needed to complete one of the three requirements to buy Shelly.
**They both also have 2{{Star}} Stamina and high Skill Check.
**Both of their Abilities also grant a large boost to one of their teammates' [[Stats]] (Tisha boosting Movement Speed and Shelly boosting Extraction Speed).
*Tisha has a closet full of {{TI|Feather Duster|name=true}}s, as stated by [[Qwel]] on the 17 October 2024 art stream.
*Tisha is one of the few [[Toons]] whose [[Ability]] ends with an exclamation mark.
*When Tisha uses her Active [[Ability]], she sometimes says, "{{Text|Gotta Sweep!}}". This dialogue is based on the character Gotta Sweep from {{wp|Baldi's Basics}}, as they share a similar personality.
*Tisha makes an appearance in [[w:c:battlefordreamisland:🥚|BFDIA 19]]. While the recommended characters are chasing [[w:c:battlefordreamisland:Book|Book]], Tisha can be seen chasing her. She was recommended by [https://www.youtube.com/@GUITARY_CONNIE GUITARY_CONNIE] and appears at 15:33.
*Tisha's release, along with [[Shelly]], was the first appearance of 2 Star [[Stamina]] if not counting [[Vee]].
*Tisha has the most interactions with another [[Toon]], having four with {{CI|Brusha|name=true}}. She is one of the first Toons to have more than 2 interactions with another.
*Tisha is ex-friends with [[Brusha]], with Tisha being the one to end the relationship.
**This was previously hinted at from a picture in the Brusha Teaser and in their interactions.
***The polaroid picture in the thumbnail has Tisha crossed out, probably by Brusha, as it is the same color as Brusha's paint on their head.
*Tisha was the last {{Type|Common}} [[Toon]] to be optimized.
**She is also the first Common (and female) to have a [[Toon of the Week]].
*Tisha is the second [[Toon]] to have the same walk and run animation with a slight difference after her optimization, with the first being {{CI|Shrimpo|name=true}}.
*The feather duster used in Tisha's [[Ability]] is invisible until her Ability is activated.
*If you enter the [[Art Gallery]] as Tisha and go to [[Brusha]]'s area, she will say "{{Text|...Wow.}}".
**If you approach the Lore Video featuring [[Brusha]] and Tisha, she will say "{{Text|No... no, no... not this-}}".
*Tisha and {{CI|Astro|name=true}} have the same dialogue box color.
*Using Tisha's [[Ability]] updates the player's light position in low graphics, making it useful for [[Blackouts]].
*Tisha's {{Skin|Mossy Stone}} [[Skin]] is most likely inspired by monstrous depictions of gargoyles, maybe also drawing inspiration from [[wp:Weeping Angels|Weeping Angels]] from [[wp:Doctor Who|Doctor Who]].

